Is that right?

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:52.760
The panel is blown out, almost from the base to the entrance.

00:22:53.340 --> 00:22:55.000
They're a mess. Unbelievable.

00:22:58.030 --> 00:22:59.550
Next, they got back into Odyssey.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:03.180
to jettison Aquarius prior to entry into the atmosphere.

00:23:03.570 --> 00:23:09.660
You dead, Aquarius?

00:23:09.880 --> 00:23:10.400
Thank you.

00:23:13.380 --> 00:23:16.500
Okay, LOS in a minute or a minute and a half,

00:23:16.720 --> 00:23:18.660
an entry attitude we'd like on me.

00:23:18.740 --> 00:23:20.930
Charlie, welcome home.

00:24:00.700 --> 00:24:02.360
ODYSSEY HOUSTON STANDING BY, OVER.

00:24:30.380 --> 00:24:30.980
Hello, sir.

00:24:31.960 --> 00:24:33.140
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:24:41.270 --> 00:24:58.650
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:24:58.750 --> 00:24:59.960
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

00:25:00.250 --> 00:25:03.280
...is 0-1 at this time, so we're going to have to wait.

00:25:07.080 --> 00:25:08.530
Roger, we're going to be 15 degrees.

00:25:11.170 --> 00:25:20.070
...1-2-1-2-0.

00:25:30.440 --> 00:25:30.840
Thank you.

00:26:10.040 --> 00:26:13.480
I recall, Captain, that when I spoke to you on the phone,

00:26:14.290 --> 00:26:18.450
you said that you regretted that you were unable to complete your mission.

00:26:19.440 --> 00:26:22.680
I hereby declare that this was a successful mission.

00:26:24.650 --> 00:26:28.800
From the start, the exploration of space has been hazardous adventure.

00:26:30.220 --> 00:26:33.380
The voyage of Apollo 13 dramatized its risks.

00:26:34.620 --> 00:26:39.330
The men of Apollo 13, by their poise and skill,

00:26:39.950 --> 00:26:42.070
under the most intense kind of pressure,

00:26:43.000 --> 00:26:48.430
epitomized the character that accepts danger and surmounts it.

00:26:50.420 --> 00:26:53.870
Theirs is the spirit that built America.

00:26:55.580 --> 00:26:57.790
Your mission served your country.

00:26:58.220 --> 00:26:59.960
It served to remind us all of...

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:07.670
our proud heritage of a nation to remind us that in this age of technicians and

00:27:07.670 --> 00:27:14.560
scientific marvels that the individual still counts that in a crisis the

00:27:15.250 --> 00:27:20.620
character of a man or of men will make the difference.

00:27:24.180 --> 00:27:29.550
Genc. Go. Surgeon. Go. Procedures. Go. AFD. Go.

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:30.680
Go.

00:27:31.060 --> 00:27:31.900
Computer soup.

00:27:32.200 --> 00:27:32.560
Go.

00:27:34.220 --> 00:27:34.480
Roger.

00:27:35.000 --> 00:27:35.420
Give me an apper.

00:27:36.350 --> 00:27:38.030
RTC on AFD conference.

00:27:38.250 --> 00:27:39.670
RTC on AFD conference.

00:27:40.070 --> 00:27:42.110
Okay, all flight controllers, let's play it cool.
